            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[Sidebar rows fit on one line. A chat that needs you shows a small symbol instead of words like "Permission" or "Question", and its folder, the chat that opened it, its key or its computer appear as small tags beside the title. Helper chats show as dots after the chat that started them, and the dots fold and unfold them. Projects with no chats and plain shells show as chips that wrap. Folders open and shut in place of the disclosure arrows.
]]></description>
